# * Route endpoints agree; μ after δ is identity; the 2-to-2 rewrite agrees.
# * Changed route, identity, boundary, and endpoint failures remain separate.
# * THE POINT -- this is one executable rewrite, not the general spider theorem.
# ***************************************************************************
